=\"/uploads/201816806/small/high-capacity-submersible-pump25326409761.jpg\"/></span></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"fr\">\n<h1 class=\"title-h1\">High Capacity Submersible Pump</h1>\n<p>We supply high capacity submersible pump. Our company has complete equipment: production line, machining center, test center and other advanced equipment. We have established relation ships with many countries. The goods are exported to Middle East, Southeast Asia,...</p>\n<a class=\"special_read\" href=\"#p1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Send Inquiry</a>\n<div class=\"share-btn-list\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"watch_botton\">\n<div class=\"button_box\">\n<button class=\"the_first\">Product Details</button>\n<p><input id=\"productID\" name=\"productID\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"52047922\"/></p><p><strong>high capacity submersible pump</strong><br/></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231610131872444.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image007(001).jpg\"/></p><p>We supply high capacity submersible pump. Our company has complete equipment: production line, machining center, test center and other advanced equipment. We have established relation ships with many countries. The goods are exported to Middle East, Southeast Asia, Europe, Africa and South American etc. Welcome friends from all over the world.</p><p><strong>1. Product Parameter (specification)</strong></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Model Number</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">4SR16</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Structure</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Multistage Pump</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Motor Power Type</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Electric</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Body Material</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Stainless Steel</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Brand Name</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">JIADI</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">For use with what product?</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Water Well</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Max. Head</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">142m</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Q Max.</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">24m3/h</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Motor Power</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">1.1-7.5kW/ 1.5-10HP</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Max. Diameter</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">98 mm</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Pump Length</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">423mm-1185mm in this series</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Outlet Connection Size</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">2 inches</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Voltage</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">220-240/380-415 volts, 50Hz</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Highest temperature water</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">35℃</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Warranty Description</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">One year</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>2. Performance Curve</strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image009(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231612106587830.jpg\"/></strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image005(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231610074581981.jpg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/></strong></p><p><strong>3. Spare Parts</strong></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td style=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\"><p>Copper Motor </p><p><img alt=\"image011(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231613268501581.jpg\"/></p><p>·Pure copper</p><p>·50Hz or 60Hz can be designed</p><p>·High speed and efficiency</p><p>·With food grade oil never pollute the water</p><p>·Lower temperature and longer lifespan for the motor</p><p><br/></p></td><td style=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\"><p>Various Choices </p><p><img alt=\"image013(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231613354594880.jpg\"/></p><p>·Stainless steel / Copper / Iron outlet（1’’~1.2’’）</p><p>·Stainless steel / Copper / Iron suction chamber</p><p>·Copper/ Iron oil chamber</p><p><br/></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\"><p>Plastic Impeller</p><p><img alt=\"image015(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231613434799381.jpg\"/></p><p>·High durable plastic, long-time using, </p><p>sand resistant</p><p>·Bearing high flow rate and pressure</p><p>·Protected by the impeller case</p><p><br/></p></td><td style=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\"><p>Mechanical Seal </p><p><img alt=\"image017(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231613556593927.jpg\"/></p><p>·Super-high precision Carborundum Graphite mechanical seal</p><p>·No oil-leakage keep the well safe</p><p>·Water and sand proof keep the motor safe</p><p><br/></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\"><p>Control Box </p><p><img alt=\"image019(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231614033815588.jpg\"/></p><p>·Control the pump running and stop</p><p>·Protecting the motor from burned down</p><p>·Various standard plug available</p><p>·Fire-resistant materials</p><p><br/></p></td><td style=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\"><p>Cable</p><p><img alt=\"image020(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231614145394152.jpg\"/></p><p>·Four cores cable</p><p>·Rubber protecting the wire</p><p>·Durable material last longer</p><p>·Various colors available</p><p>·Cable produced by JIADI</p><p><br/></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>4. Pump/Motor</strong></p><p>NEMA standard.</p><p>Q max: 15.7(m3/h)</p><p>Insulation class: B </p><p>Protection grade: IP 68</p><p>Maximum diameter: 98mm</p><p>Continuous duty.</p><p>Options of different materials are available.</p><p><strong>5. Application</strong></p><p>Used in factories, mines, building water supply, farm irrigation and drainage, urban and rural household use, industrial water supply, and so on. </p><p><img alt=\"image021(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231619061411033.jpg\"/></p><p><strong>6. Product Certification</strong></p><p><img alt=\"image023(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231619372349320.jpg\"/><br/></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">ISO14001 </td><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">OHSAS18001</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">CE </td></tr></tbody></table><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231619399808639.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image025(001).jpg\"/><br/></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">GS </td><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">ISO9001 </td><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">RoHS</td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>7.FAQ</strong></p><p><strong>Q1: What's your MOQ?</strong></p><p>A: Usually 10 sets. Sample for testing is available</p><p><strong>Q2: Are you a factory or a trading company?</strong></p><p>A: We are a manufacturer that specializes in multistage deep well submersible pumps for more than 30 years.</p><p><strong>Q3: What's the order procedure? </strong></p><p>A: First we discuss order details, production details by email. Then we issue you an PI for your confirmation. You will be requested to do prepaid full payment or deposit before we go into production. After we get the payment, we start to process the order. We usually need 15-30 days if we don't have the items in stock. Before production has been finished, we will contact you for shipment details, and the balance payment. After payment has been settled, we start to prepare the shipment for you. </p><p><strong>Q4: How do you check all the goods in the production line?</strong> </p><p>A: We have spot inspection and finished product inspection. We check the goods when they go into next step production procedure. </p><p><strong><br/></strong><br/></p><p><br/></p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"productsTags\"> Hot Tags: high capacity submersible pump, China, suppliers, manufacturers, buy</p>\n<div class=\"ptit\">Related Products</div>\n<ul class=\"rollPro1\">\n<li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/4-submersible-pump/4sr-4-deep-well-submersible-pump/high-pressure-submersible-pump\"><img alt=\"High Pressure Submersible Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/high-pressure-submersible-pump57042214921a77d.jpg?size=263x0\"/></a></div>\n<p><a href=\"/4-submersible-pump/4sr-4-deep-well-submersible-pump/high-pressure-submersible-pump\">High Pressure Submersible Pump</a></p>\n</li><li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/4-submersible-pump/4-ss-submersible-pump/submersible-bore-pump\"><img alt=\"Submersible Bore Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/submersible-bore-pump39394512947a77d.jpg?size=263x0\"/></a></div>\n<p><a href=\"/4-submersible-pump/4-ss-submersible-pump/submersible-bore-pump\">Submersible Bore Pump</a></p>